": "807815134514095", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974745_807815137847428_8091744787681377138_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0KC7_GA61xQQ7kNvwFoQTyM&_nc_oc=Adrm7uRb13RdKp0j5DBuOjGsz2_VMifj94EKqknKxyHWIIR9xWJp4hh9HOSsHywZ1MQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcJ3EaxWjy_dOqyKYzjylRzQTkSruwNLEEPttsWj25jw&oe=6AF73DD1"}]}, "id": "1991503715587002", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "05.png", "id": "762039692474099", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036671_762039695807432_7929028302303197229_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W6yi1F_UbjEQ7kNvwFM54GK&_nc_oc=AdqC9S90NgkqSZMfUC0x83TwpA_3_llEsJOuVudOt3z-BeLiIbmY71Vgl00Oy1t-A9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRpLL4vS5L2v61QGeUeXlLUVgOZl5SHQlmhj-Iwswourw&oe=6AF73107"}, {"file_name": "11.png", "id": "686465033696644", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75314851_686465037029977_6612744758988883540_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GuhJDpWZSjwQ7kNvwHaM3N2&_nc_oc=Adopj32euEjBRLF2ovhFdY3l7neREwgQFWRzv2H8RvqlzdUJueho6YD5Bt5b8jjOYYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSste2_6s0VDK0beuC8XH6COd33tNODaJmFxLxWV-rjbw&oe=6AF71584"}, {"file_name": "07.png", "id": "3754270494819826", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031410_3754270498153159_6334664900095817647_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8GL_bbazWAgQ7kNvwGhnAqM&_nc_oc=AdrFpSPB5cMH7GAMVp8GZ6RihB_PXPcpNEQb28ZRhYUYxd0qgrVdiy-ugUqpNZgG3n4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuZm6ErNTm3QDpWWc4CHjy9RvdT-3s9pJwUA36You7Gw&oe=6AF7255A"}, {"file_name": "08.png", "id": "401824872497162", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982470_401824875830495_6886804828124866932_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P8ccGFsiOCMQ7kNvwHSo349&_nc_oc=AdoYRctY52zTiHXhSXVh4izimrBc68zrqLhQK1n7erheCElcnBFdYF5kLdn4h08N7Ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSADiqV8CL_jfU8MbOBRObGM2E86KNUj3PCryeSBUd8CA&oe=6AF73C49"}, {"file_name": "13.png", "id": "316272631457017", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031454_316272634790350_3064227896207871112_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qlnImbEEFpYQ7kNvwELiNkI&_nc_oc=Adpy6zWaSNJPcfHQpfAUDdVKd8FLxB7NIKxz8dT7-KO36FeAAIAjM9jg9t-ndGkmA3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmVilHYhLbc1hulr__-7Vc3H96cXDWchjFEp5IbDCORA&oe=6AF745D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ET_meta_2560x1440.png", "id": "334719156393952", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340710_334719159727285_2662614486446128346_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oDMF1lBf9OsQ7kNvwFil4HB&_nc_oc=Adp1uAsM3skXCcJrXIvjRXUEteCFs9qG62rWj7cFAVpzyR5x3HZQMlK8EgeME8jcfBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRMRhkvALjSl9BiO_OEwno86IsFz5YqMvEePVxNNUku-Q&oe=6AF73820"}, "display_name": "Global Workforce VR Career Training", "keywords": ["career", "vocational", "cte", "workforce", "training"], "long_description": "# Bring real-world skills into your CTE classroom with immersive VR training.\n\nGWPro.io helps students safely practice job-ready skills, connect theory to real-world scenarios, and build confidence before entering labs, job sites, or work-based learning programs.\n\n**Why CTE Teachers Choose GWPro**\n\n- CTE-Aligned VR Modules covering safety, skilled trades, healthcare, and career exploration\n- Safe, Risk-Free Practice \u2014 students learn by doing, without real-world consequences\n- Standards-Based Content aligned with industry safety and certification frameworks\n- Designed for Classrooms with teacher-led multiplayer and individual practice modes\n- Built-In Assessment Support using \u201cLook-Fors\u201d to observe and evaluate key skills\n- High Engagement for today\u2019s digital-native learners\n\n**Easy to Use**\n\n- Works with major VR headsets (Meta, Pico, HTC, DPVR)\n- One-button setup \u2014 no prior VR experience required\n\nTrusted by CTE programs worldwide to improve engagement, safety, and workforce readiness.\n\nAll VR Training consists of 3 modes: Study, Training, Exam, providing step-by-step control of all VR activities.\n\nLanguage support: English, Bahasa Melayu (\u0628\u0647\u0627\u0633 \u0645\u0644\u0627\u064a\u0648), \u010ce\u0161tina, Deutsch, Espa\u00f1ol, Fran\u00e7ais, Italiano, Latvie\u0161u, Nederlands, Polski, Portugu\u00eas, Sloven\u010dina, Svenska, Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, \u0627\u064e\u0644\u0652\u0639\u064e\u0631\u064e\u0628\u0650\u064a\u064e\u0651\u0629\u064f, \u0641\u0627\u0631\u0633\u06cc, \u666e\u901a\u8bdd (\u4e2d\u56fd\u5927\u9646), \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e, \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be (\u09ad\u09be\u09b0\u09a4), \u0a97\u0ac1\u0a9c\u0ab0\u0abe\u0aa4\u0ac0 (\u0aad\u0abe\u0ab0\u0aa4), \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 (\u092d\u093e\u0930\u0924), \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1 (\u0cad\u0cbe\u0cb0\u0ca4), \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940 (\u092d\u093e\u0930\u0924) and more. \n\n**Start your VR-powered CTE training today.**\n\n", "short_description": "Immersive VR training for CTE. \nGWPro helps students safely practice job-ready skills, bridge theory and practice, and prepare for real careers."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1r7fPASKr-4XFrvk21IGtZ-w_H0dYz9jk/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=111001160316405883703&rtpof=true&sd=true", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GWPro VR Training", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gwpro.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "cont